B.Y7=new A.fA("Fire","Fire deals decreasing damage in cleanup: it starts at its applied value and drops by 1 each turn.")
B.Yf=new A.fA("Stun","A stunned unit loses its next turn. Stun takes effect through cleanup and blocks the next action phase.")
B.Y6=new A.fA("Taunt","Taunt is a built-in passive. It visually changes the unit frame and redirects attacks meant for the protected allies.")
B.Yh=new A.fA("Rage","Rage gives attack after the unit takes damage, so the bonus only matters on later turns.")
B.Y5=new A.fA("Knockback","Knockback pushes targets away in cleanup before advancing. A knocked unit cannot advance that same turn.")
B.Yc=new A.fA("Buff Attack","Buff Attack increases attack in cleanup and only affects future turns.")
